# GTK 4 and the libraries under it, each from its upstream release by its own
# build: Meson for FreeType, FriBidi, HarfBuzz, fontconfig, pixman, cairo,
# graphene, libepoxy, gdk-pixbuf, pango and GTK (its X11 backend alone),
# CMake for expat, libpng, libjpeg-turbo and libtiff, and this recipe's
# Makefile and script for gperf (fontconfig's build runs it) and the five X
# extension libraries GTK's X11 backend links. Static libraries in /usr/lib,
# as a GTK program links them; GLib's pkg-config file has cc cast-emulate
# every GObject program, those these builds run among them.
